    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eenata e mpukuroto nasipa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Teyietu nchira, nimigira, tabuaku ilepunye oltoilo lino anaa entarumpeta; mbalakinye iltung'ana laainei nkitarruorot enye, mbalakinye enkaji e Yakobo ing'ok enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore eyia, kaaing'oru ninche anaake, neng'ida ninche te neyiolou nkoitoi aainei, eji netiu anaa olosho oas isupati, leitu epuo aaing'uaa nkiguanat e Nkai enye; kaaikilikuan ninche nkiguanat naasipa, neng'ida ninche etaaniki Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kainyoo pee kiteena iyiook ate, aaitupukoo? Nimidol iyie. Kainyoo pee kintoborro iyiook ate, neitu iyie ishilaa ina? Ng'ura, ore te nkolong e enata ino, ning'oru iyie murruna ino makewan, nintorogony ilaisiaayiak linono pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ura, iyeniyene intae ate pee itumokiki aailepilepa nintayuyu olarrabal. Ore eenata neeijo ena inyi ena olong, nemeisho iltoiloishi linyi metoning'i te shumata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kena enata empukuroto ategelua nanu, ina olong naitobor oltung'ani kewan? Ke nkolong nairrug oltung'ani endukuya enye anaa enkujita, neisalaash ilkuniyiani o nkuruon ti abori ninye? Ilo iyie ajo ena eenata e mpukuroto, naa enkolong nang'amaroyu to Laitoriani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aime ena eenata empukoroto nategelua nanu: pee elaari ienat e ntorroni, neitololong'i nkeenta e nchata too murto, ore ilo oitorogonyaki nelaari meshomo, negili pooki shata oo murto? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.25.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 25.35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aime pee ing'arie endaa ino ilo oisumash, neyau ilo aisinani le meeta ang atua enkaji ino; ore pee idol ilo lemeishopo ninchop, neme pee isudoo kewan te lelo tung'ana leeijo iyie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netum taa ewang'an ino atotiuo anaa enkakenya, ore enkishiunoto ino nelotu asieku; ore esupatisho ino nelo te dukuya ino, ore enkitoo o Laitoriani neaku ninye nikirrip te siadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimpotisho iyie, nikiwaliki Olaitoriani; ore pee nchir iyie, nejo ninye, Nele nanu. Tiniwuang'ieng'ie ti atua ate ina shata e murt, o ina utata o lkimojino, o enkiroroto torrono, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ti nipukokiki intae maate lelo ooisumash, nintaraposhosho eyieunoto e ilo oata osina, netum taa ewang'an inyi ailepu te naimin ore emisimisi inyi netiu anaa enkipirata e nkolong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikirikoo iyie Olaitoriani anaake, nikintaraposh Olaitoriani iyieunot inono too mbaa sidain, neitagol iloik linono, nitiu iyie anaa enkurma natubukokoki enkare, nitiu anaa enchorro e nkare, nemeishunye ae kata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore wuejitin inono apa naaidaikieki nesheti; naa ilo iyie adumu olkitamanyunoto loo ishoritin kumok; nikipuoi aajo olaramani too lusien olaitobirani loo nkoitoi naalala enkanasa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olerrinyore te nkaraki enkibung'ata e Sabato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ti nimbelekeny iroruat inono apaash sabato, nipaash isiaitin inono te nkolong ai sinyati, nintaa iyie sabato enkolong e nchipai o enkolong sinyati o Laitoriani nayanyiti; ti niyanyitu iyie ina olong, nimilo too nkoitoi inono makewan, anaa ing'oru enchipai ino makewan, anaa iro mbaa e pesho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 58:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nitumoki taa atishipakinoyu ina olong o Laitoriani, naaisho nanu iyie shomo too wuejitin e shumata e nkop; naaitoti nanu iyie te ina jung'ore e Yakobo papaai lino, amu enkutuk o Laitoriani nairoro kuna.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.58.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.58.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
